config INPUT_XIAOMI_KEYBOARD
	tristate "Xiaomi keyboard companion driver"
	depends on OF
	help
	  Companion driver for the Nanosic keyboard/touchpad found on Xiaomi
	  tablets.  It exports the touchpad edge filter that the Nanosic driver
	  calls into and exposes the keyboard status through sysfs.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called xiaomi_keyboard.
